#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Cannot access %1\n"
"Make sure that the device exists and that you have write permission to it."
msgstr ""
"Tidak dapat akses %1\n"
"Pastikan peranti itu ada dan anda mempunyai keizinan tulis."

